{
    "version": "5.6.1",
    "description": "Paste clipboard contents into files, or copy file contents to the clipboard, from the Explorer context menu or a global hotkey",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/eltos/PasteIntoFile",
    "license": "MIT",
    "url": "https://github.com/eltos/PasteIntoFile/releases/download/v5.6.1/PasteIntoFile_v5.6.1_portable_signed.zip",
    "hash": "c1fadd3923f308c63771170188ee41ab35bcac473402f63e1bbdccc7926529f7",
    "bin": "PasteIntoFile.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "PasteIntoFile.exe",
            "Paste Into File"
        ]
    ],
    "pre_install": "if (!(Test-Path \"$persist_dir\\settings.config\")) { New-Item \"$dir\\settings.config\" -ItemType File -Force | Out-Null }",
    "post_install": [
        "# 与官方 MSI 安装包行为一致：注册右键菜单并开启托盘自启。$dir 是 current junction，注册表记录的路径升级后依然有效",
        "if (Test-Path \"$dir\\PasteIntoFile.exe\") {",
        "    & \"$dir\\PasteIntoFile.exe\" config --register",
        "    & \"$dir\\PasteIntoFile.exe\" config --enable-autostart",
        "}"
    ],
    "pre_uninstall": [
        "if (Test-Path \"$dir\\PasteIntoFile.exe\") {",
        "    & \"$dir\\PasteIntoFile.exe\" config --unregister 2>$null",
        "    & \"$dir\\PasteIntoFile.exe\" config --disable-autostart",
        "}",
        "# config --unregister 遇到不存在的菜单项会中止，这里按官方 MSI 的注册表键列表兜底清理",
        "$entries = 'Directory\\shell\\PasteIntoFile', 'Directory\\Background\\shell\\PasteIntoFile', '*\\shell\\PasteIntoFile', '*\\shell\\PasteIntoFile_replace', '*\\shell\\PasteIntoFile_replace_append'",
        "$entries | ForEach-Object { Remove-Item -LiteralPath \"HKCU:\\Software\\Classes\\$_\" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }"
    ],
    "persist": "settings.config",
    "notes": [
        "安装后已按官方安装包的做法注册资源管理器右键菜单（粘贴到文件 / 复制文件内容 / 粘贴并替换）并开启开机托盘自启，Windows 11 需在“显示更多选项”里查看。",
        "首次启动会弹出向导，可调整右键菜单项、托盘自启、热键 Win+Alt+V 与文件名模板；在向导里取消勾选的项在下次升级后会被重新注册。",
        "便携版把设置写在程序目录的 settings.config，已通过 persist 持久化，升级与卸载（不带 -p）均不丢失。",
        "命令行可用：pasteintofile help（paste / copy / config 等子命令，如 pasteintofile config --disable-autostart）。",
        "需要 .NET Framework 4.8（Windows 10 1903 及以上、Windows 11 均已内置）。",
        "本仓库另有 `pasteintofile-classic`：原作者 EslaMx7 的旧版（v1.5，2020 年停更）；本清单是其维护中的续作。"
    ],
    "checkver": "github",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/eltos/PasteIntoFile/releases/download/v$version/PasteIntoFile_v$version_portable_signed.zip"
    }
}
